{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37917","headline":"读侯道华真人传 · 崔涂","name":"读侯道华真人传","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉皇轻万乘，方士说三丹。\n不得修心要，翻知出世难。\n茂陵春竟绿，金掌曙空寒。\n何似先生去，翩翩逐彩鸾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔涂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37917.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37917","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}